ret: 033200, giving a variation on F/E.) N: (Learned from Cantor Jeff Klepper's "Guitarist on the Roof" workshop)N: -AWK:Dm"A"^cdeg |fed^c| ed^cd|e3 ^c|"Bb"Bd^cB |d^cBd |"A"^cBAG |A3 A|"A"^cdeg |fed^c| ed^cd|e3 ^c|"Bb"BAGB |"A"AGFE|"Dm"D4|D4||"Gm"D Bz ^c |ed^cd|ed^cd |"A"e4|"Gm"D Bz ^c |ed^cd|ed^cB  |"A"A2A2|"Gm"D Bz ^c |ed^cd|ed^cd |"A"e3^c|"Bb"Bd^cB |"A"AGFE|"Dm"D4 |D4|]X:6T: Tracie's Two-StepT: Military Two- StepC: Gordon TracieL: 1/8M: 6/8K: CW: Play just one of the two introductions.W: The chords in lines 7 and 10 should be played pizzicato on stringed instruments."First Intro" G,CE D2 E | C3 c3 ||"G7" "Second Intro" g^fg =fdB| G^FG =FDB,| G,A,^A, B,C^C | D3 g2 |||: G | "C" cBc A2 G | EGA GED | CDE A2 E | G3-G2 G |\cBc A2 G | EGA GE_E | "D7" D^FA cBA | "G7" G3-G2 G |"C" cBc A2 G | EGA GED |"C7" C2 D EDC | "F" F3-F3 |\A^GA CFA | "C" G^F G E=FG | "G7" BAG FED | "C" C3-C2 :||: E| "G7" D2 E FED | E2 F G2 E | "G7" D2 E FED | "C" G3-G2 G |\"D7" ^F2 G AGF | "G" G2A B2 c | "D" d2 d cBA | "G7" G3 "pizz." .[G,2DBg] G |"C" cBc A2 G | EGA GED | C2 D EDC | "F" A3-A2 A |\|1 cBc FGA | "C" G^FG E=FG | "G7" BAG FED | "C" C3-C2 :||2 "F" cBc "Fm" dcd | "C" ecA G3 | Gce "G7" d2 e | "C" c3 "pizz.".[G,2Ec] |]X:7T:Russian Two Step IIS:SPUDSZ:abc-edited-by: AW%%partsbox true% Chord changes from SPUDS version:% m. 12 F chord instead of Dm% B music m.1,5 changed to G A DM:2/4K:DmP:A"Dm"A2d4d2| "A"^c3_BA4|A2e4e2|"Dm" fgfed4| "Dm"A2d4d2|"A"^c3_B A4|a2g2 f2e2|"Dm"d4d4|"D7"d2a4a2|"Gm"b3ag4|"C"g2c'4g2|"F"a3gf4|"Dm"d2f4f2|"A"g3fe4|a2g2 f2e2|"Dm"d4d4|]P:BK:D"G6".e4"A7".g4|"D".f4z2f2|"A"a2g2e4|"D"g2f2d4|"G6".e4"A7".g4|"D".f4z2f2|"A"a2g2 f2e2|"D"d4d4|"G"g2b4g2|"D"f2a4f2|"A"e2g4e2|"D"fefga4|"G"g2b4g2|"D"f2a4f2|"A"a3g f2e2|"D"d4d4|]X:8T:If I Were a Rich Man (excerpt)C:Jerry BockZ:(and arr.) AW%%partsbox trueQ:1/2=118%%printtempo false%M:4/4M:C| % for contraL:1/8K:CP:Ay"C"GFGF E2C2 | z2 EF GFGF | EFGA _BABA | G2z2 z4 | "G7"_A2G2_G2F2 | "